<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits and ISWAP militants are intensifying attacks across northern Nigeria, with gunmen targeting civilians, soldiers and mining sites in Plateau, while troops repel assaults on Fulani settlements and Christian communities. Nigerian forces have killed two ISWAP terrorists in Adamawa and recovered weapons, and troops rescued a six-year-old boy abducted in Kaduna. A reported bandit leader, Kachalla Bello, was killed in Katsina, and gunmen have kidnapped and later released a mother and three sons after a ransom demand. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ZAgazola&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPM0VJVW5wNjlFSDY3dzhSaTZTWllvdjQxc01HRUNXbHhwZVZtWVdPdW1MRzdXSFZyV2QxWjB4Z0M3dFFpdWpYRXRxYlJYeEw4UFpJU3gzOTJ0UnNjSUNfcUFnREFMUFJoMHR3c2Yxelk1ZmE4bUMzQ2UxS0IySkRHSTVDYy1SZGxBTWx3a2owNDBtam5JVFB2TDRWZVVRYklrX1NSSTQ4ZzdEQUUxdmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;zagazola.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNa2diUnNuMHR4bjNQZUVJSjBiaDFhVnVCN2VfVTZFZHMtVklMUm9ONmg4eGtVUG55MV9iS3hFWHRIR0liSW1kVEdobTlBSlFKY0d1MWxaejFCdDV2RTJNdEZZNGpQMlpSUjI1cFJZbkJFSHBTSExNSkd4bXJON3l1cFBrdWVEZElYdlhXS2VsM1Q5ekotZE43amJnUXdxblg5X1l3emlIMUg4Y1YtNTE3QUdveGltWl9KNlRzdg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOellDWG